{
  "an3.67:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.67 ",
  "an3.67:0.2": "7. Mahāvagga ",
  "an3.67:0.3": "Kathāvatthusutta ",
  "an3.67:1.1": "“Tīṇimāni, bhikkhave, kathāvatthūni. ",
  "an3.67:1.2": "Katamāni tīṇi? ",
  "an3.67:1.3": "Atītaṁ vā, bhikkhave, addhānaṁ ārabbha kathaṁ katheyya: ",
  "an3.67:1.4": "‘evaṁ ahosi atītamaddhānan’ti. ",
  "an3.67:1.5": "Anāgataṁ vā, bhikkhave, addhānaṁ ārabbha kathaṁ katheyya: ",
  "an3.67:1.6": "‘evaṁ bhavissati anāgatamaddhānan’ti. ",
  "an3.67:1.7": "Etarahi vā, bhikkhave, paccuppannaṁ addhānaṁ ārabbha kathaṁ katheyya: ",
  "an3.67:1.8": "‘evaṁ hoti etarahi paccuppannamaddhānan’ti. ",
  "an3.67:2.1": "Kathāsampayogena, bhikkhave, puggalo veditabbo yadi vā kaccho yadi vā akacchoti. ",
  "an3.67:2.2": "Sacāyaṁ, bhikkhave, puggalo pañhaṁ puṭṭho samāno ekaṁsabyākaraṇīyaṁ pañhaṁ na ekaṁsena byākaroti, vibhajjabyākaraṇīyaṁ pañhaṁ na vibhajja byākaroti, paṭipucchābyākaraṇīyaṁ pañhaṁ na paṭipucchā byākaroti, ṭhapanīyaṁ pañhaṁ na ṭhapeti, evaṁ santāyaṁ, bhikkhave, puggalo akaccho hoti. ",
  "an3.67:2.3": "Sace panāyaṁ, bhikkhave, puggalo pañhaṁ puṭṭho samāno ekaṁsabyākaraṇīyaṁ pañhaṁ ekaṁsena byākaroti, vibhajjabyākaraṇīyaṁ pañhaṁ vibhajja byākaroti, paṭipucchābyākaraṇīyaṁ pañhaṁ paṭipucchā byākaroti, ṭhapanīyaṁ pañhaṁ ṭhapeti, evaṁ santāyaṁ, bhikkhave, puggalo kaccho hoti. ",
  "an3.67:3.